feat proto-structs: generate operator==

* clang-20 crashes on `operator==() = default` with recursion.

  Minimal reproducer:

  ```cpp
  struct Foo {
      bool operator==(const Foo&) const;

      std::vector<Foo> foo;  // ok
  };

  inline bool Foo::operator==(const Foo&) const = default;
  ```

  https://godbolt.org/z/Mz4q89rja

* As a workaround, generate manual field-by-field `operator==` implementations.

* Example of generated code:

  ```cpp
  bool Upper::operator==([[maybe_unused]] const Upper& rhs) const {
      return true &&
          XYandexUid == rhs.XYandexUid &&
          Float == rhs.Float &&
          New == rhs.New;
  }
  ```

* Hack: make `proto_structs::UnbreakableDependencyCycle` equality-comparable.
